# Every text file is stored with LF, on every platform.
#
# The engine builds and is tested on macOS. A checkout that carried CRLF into the
# sources would make the file the compiler reads differ, byte for byte, from the
# file the repository stores — and nothing downstream can tell that it happened.
# Saying it here makes it a property of the repository rather than of whoever
# happened to be on Windows when a file was written.
* text=auto eol=lf
